Generic single-database configuration.# Service Booking & Appointment Management System

A backend REST API for managing service bookings and appointments between customers and service providers.

The system supports authentication, role-based authorization, service management, provider availability, bookings, payments, reviews, notifications, and dashboards.

---

## 🚀 Features

### Authentication & Authorization
- User registration and login
- JWT-based authentication
- Password hashing using bcrypt
- Role-based access control
- Three user roles:
  - Customer
  - Provider
  - Admin

### Services
- Providers can create services
- View available services
- Update services
- Delete services
- Service price and duration validation

### Provider Availability
- Providers can define their working days
- Configure start and end times
- Availability validation
- Prevent invalid time ranges

### Bookings
- Customers can create bookings
- Automatic provider assignment through the selected service
- Provider availability validation
- Prevent past appointments
- Prevent duplicate time slots
- Booking status management

### Booking Status Workflow

```text
Pending
   │
   ├──> Confirmed
   │       │
   │       ├──> Completed
   │       │
   │       └──> Cancelled
   │
   └──> Cancelled